Error [E0140]: `db` must be used exactly once, but it is never used
  --> tests/ui/single_use_dropped.jet:12:5
    |
 12 |     db :: acquire("db")
    |     ^^
 Why: this value's type is `#SingleUse`, so it carries a job that has to be done — dropping it without doing that job leaves the work undone (an unjoined task, an unreleased lock)
 Fix: give it away exactly once: move it to a `^` parameter, or `return` it
